<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures mixed, Sept S&amp;P turns up.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures mixed, Sept S&amp;P turns up.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 16 - U.S. stock index futures were mixed early, but Sept turned higher. Record high looms at 906.40, Sept makes a daily high of 905.80. Traders note strengthening T-bonds. Traders said June/September spread action brisk early ahead of June S&amp;P expiration Thursday.</p>
